WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:07.840
People have asked throughout the years how this is fair, but there is one main reason for this. The EU was set up

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:15.060
not only to allow for freedom of trade, prevent conflicts and political cooperation, but also to rebuild economies.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:22.280
The theory for this practice is that if economies can rebuild structures which allow for future revenue, the economy

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:29.800
will become more active, which can have several effects, such as increasing employment rates, increased taxation,

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:37.880
therefore increased government revenue, increased selection of goods for consumers, increase trading among EU

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:38.400
states.
